Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.17,0:00:09.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  嘿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey. Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.63,0:00:13.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们在干什么  我们想填完字谜再去睡觉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What are you guys doing up? We wanted to finish the crossword before bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.01,0:00:17.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道三个字  也是红色的一种\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Do you know a six-letter word for "red"?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.68,0:00:20.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,深红色\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Dark-red.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.60,0:00:25.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,应该不是  不过你待会可以玩连连看\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I think that's wrong, but there's a connect-the-dots in here for you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.23,0:00:29.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  赭红色呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, how, uh, about maroon?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.36,0:00:32.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没错  你好聪明\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yes! You are so smart! Ha-ha-ha.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.36,0:00:34.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哇\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Aw.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.57,0:00:36.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们好可爱啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You guys are so cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.24,0:00:37.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.49,0:00:40.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  明早见\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right. I'll see you in the morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.37,0:00:42.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.26,0:00:57.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我最喜欢跟你玩填字谜了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know, I love doing crossword puzzles with you, honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.30,0:00:58.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我也是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.51,0:01:00.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,赶快填完去睡觉  好的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Now, let's finish this and go to bed. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.14,0:01:02.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只剩一个\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}There's only one left.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.77,0:01:06.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,叁个字的动物  不是小狗  是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Three-letter word. Not dog, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.44,0:01:09.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,猫咪\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Cat.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.19,0:01:11.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没错\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yes. Ha.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.90,0:01:14.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你好聪明\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You are so smart!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.07,0:01:17.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我爱你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.41,0:01:18.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我也爱你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I love you too.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.05,0:01:35.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,老友记  第五季  第16集  警察来了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Friends  S05E16  The One With A Cop
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.14,0:01:46.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演: 珍妮佛·安妮斯顿
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.89,0:01:50.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演: 寇妮·考克斯
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.61,0:01:54.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演: 丽莎·库卓
