Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.62,0:02:10.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演: 大卫·修蒙
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.35,0:02:25.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还差小费\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We still need a tip.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.89,0:02:28.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  等等\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right. Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.60,0:02:30.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.77,0:02:32.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,5分钱\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Nickel.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.86,0:02:35.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还差多少  2块钱\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}How much more do we need? A couple of bucks.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.03,0:02:37.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,10分钱\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, dime.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.36,0:02:41.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们继续聊  我会多花一点时间\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You guys should probably keep talking. This could take a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.62,0:02:42.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等等  你们看\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wait, lookit!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.03,0:02:44.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哇啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.58,0:02:46.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天哪  这是警徽\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, my God. This is a police badge!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.70,0:02:50.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真酷  但警察来这里干嘛  这里又不卖甜甜圈\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14} Oh that's so cool! Why would a cop come in here though? They don't serve donuts. Ha.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.84,0:02:54.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你能不能重来一次\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Y'know what actually, could you discover the badge again?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.42,0:02:56.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我可以说个更好笑的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I think I can come up with something better than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.13,0:03:00.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,菲比   一定有人正在找那个警徽\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Phoebe, I bet somebody's missing that badge.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.51,0:03:03.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没错  我应该送回去  知道吗  我去了警察局\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, I should take it back. Ooh,  but you know what? While I'm at the police station, ...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.89,0:03:05.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还可以看看十大通缉犯名单\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...I could check their Ten Most Wanted list.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.06,0:03:09.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为我朋友丽西一直是排名第11大  今年也许会走运\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}because my friend Fritzi's been Number 11 forever. so this could be her year! 
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.06,0:03:14.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  大家好  嘿  乔伊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, you guys. Hey, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.73,0:03:17.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  嘿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey. Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.23,0:03:19.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是我的衣服吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey. That uh, that my sweatshirt?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.82,0:03:23.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对  对不起  我会冷  冷了就借来穿了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yes, it is. I'm sorry. I borrowed it. I was cold. I hope it's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.45,0:03:26.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没关系吧  你要穿  应该穿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's just that, uh, if you wear someone's sweatshirt...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.16,0:03:29.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你男朋友的衣服  才对吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...shouldn't it be your boyfriend's?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.66,0:03:31.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不是你的男朋友\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And I'm not him.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.71,0:03:34.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对不起  我现在就还你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm sorry. I'll give it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.21,0:03:35.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  不  不要\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, no. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.63,0:03:38.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,上面会沾满你的味道\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I mean it's gonna be all smelling like Monica!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.96,0:03:40.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是说我很臭吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Are you saying I smell bad?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.47,0:03:41.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  不是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.68,0:03:43.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你有一股青草香\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You smell like a meadow.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.18,0:03:47.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对不起\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.43,0:03:51.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他是怎么了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What's with him?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.73,0:03:56.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乔伊上次去青草地  他妈妈被猎人射杀了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, y'know what? The last time Joey went to a meadow, his mother was shot by a hunter.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.50,0:04:15.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我还是不确定\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, I still don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.92,0:04:19.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉  我想买到理想的沙发  我希望这张沙发能让人觉得\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm sorry I just wanna make sure that I bought the right couch. I need a couch that says:
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.05,0:04:24.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"小朋友  欢迎"  同时也能让人觉得\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}"Kids welcome here," but that also says
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.64,0:04:26.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"来我身边吧"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}"Come here to me."
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.01,0:04:32.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么  你对小朋友说那种话\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What? You say that to kids?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.02,0:04:34.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  不  不是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.23,0:04:38.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"来我身边吧"  是对小姐们说的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}The "Come here to me" is, you know, for the ladies.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.61,0:04:42.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗斯  这是张好沙发  但不是神奇沙发\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ross, honey, it's a nice couch, not a magic couch.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.57,0:04:46.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对啊  你的选择很正确\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, you picked a great couch.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.24,0:04:47.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是吗  是的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.49,0:04:48.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没错  请在这里签个名  没问题\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah. Could you just sign right here please? Oh, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.12,0:04:51.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没问题  这是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, what's, heh--?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.62,0:04:54.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,运费几乎跟沙发价格一样贵\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}The delivery charge is almost as much as the couch!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.33,0:04:57.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真是太扯了  他家离这里才三条街\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's ridiculous. He lives three blocks away.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.38,0:05:00.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,算了  我自己搬好了  谢谢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know what? I'll take it myself. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.09,0:05:02.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瑞秋  来吧  好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right, Rash, come on. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.92,0:05:04.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.39,0:05:11.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,开什么玩笑\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Are you kidding?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.06,0:05:16.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,才三条街  又不是很重  抬抬看  快  快\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Come on. It's only three blocks. Uh, it's not very heavy. Try it. Come on! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.57,0:05:23.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喔  我行嘛  行\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, I can do it. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.82,0:05:26.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们会很喜欢这张沙发的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You two will really enjoy that couch.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.20,0:05:29.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们  不是一对\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We're, uh, not together.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.66,0:05:31.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哇啊  哦  哦\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, okay. Yeah. Ha-ha-ha.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.62,0:05:33.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,难怪我看着怪怪的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Something didn't quite add up there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.96,0:05:40.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗斯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ross.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.38,0:05:42.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你这话是什么意思  罗斯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What's that supposed to mean? Ross.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.34,0:05:45.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你  她\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, you. Her. Heh.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.67,0:05:47.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她很...你知道 \N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I mean, she's very...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.72,0:05:48.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.18,0:05:50.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And you're, like...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.97,0:05:52.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而你却\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}"NQU know'?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.35,0:05:59.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,虽然与你无关  但我们确实交往过\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Not that it's any of your business, but we did go out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.36,0:06:00.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真的  你们两个\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Really? You two?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.81,0:06:01.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对  瑞秋\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah. Rash'?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.02,0:06:05.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我现在不想说这个  我抬着一张很重的沙发\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Come on, I don't really want to be doing this right now. I am carrying a very heavy couch.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.74,0:06:08.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那你就赶快告诉他啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Then tell him quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.66,0:06:10.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  我们交往过\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Fine. We went out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.70,0:06:12.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不只交往过\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Not only did we go out...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.16,0:06:16.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们还做过298次\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...we did it 298 times!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.29,0:06:18.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗斯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ross.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.62,0:06:20.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我实在\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, WV"
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.21,0:06:24.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你居然在计算  真没用\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ugh, you kept count? You are such a loser!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.17,0:06:29.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,再没用你也做了298次\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}A loser you did it with 298 times!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.72,0:06:35.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哇  啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh. Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.60,0:06:39.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这位小姐  怎么了  你不能在树上熄香烟\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Excuse me, ma'am. You can't put your cigarette out on a tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.10,0:06:41.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没事  我可以  很方便的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, I can. It worked well.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.65,0:06:45.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你不该这么做  别再这么做了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But you shouldn't. So don't ever do that again.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.94,0:06:48.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不会了  抽下一根烟之前不会\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I won't till I have my next cigarette.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.11,0:06:50.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,站住\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hold it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.57,0:06:52.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,纽约警察  别动\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}NYPD. Freeze, punk!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.66,0:06:54.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.28,0:06:57.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没错  你被活逮了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's right. You are so busted.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.08,0:06:59.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,把她带走\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Book 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.17,0:07:04.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你在跟谁说话  别挣扎了  红发女\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Who are you talking to? Save it, red!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.46,0:07:08.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不想在笼子里过夜  就跟那颗树道歉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Unless you want to spend the night in the slammer, you apologize to the tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.97,0:07:11.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我才不跟一颗树道歉呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I am not going to apologize to a tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.01,0:07:15.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,赶快道歉  否则我要叫人了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You apologize to the tree right now, or I am calling for backup.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.02,0:07:19.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,来人啊  来人啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Backup! Backup!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.48,0:07:21.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对不起  对不起\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm sorry! Sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.40,0:07:24.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  别来了  别来了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, cancel backup! Cancel backup!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.44,0:07:27.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.65,0:07:30.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗斯  你不是说有电梯嘛\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ross, didn't you say that there was an elevator in here?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.74,0:07:34.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是有说  但其实没有  来吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Uhh, yes I did but there isn't. Okay, here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.41,0:07:37.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  往左\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, go left.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.37,0:07:39.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,左  左\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Left. Left.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.71,0:07:43.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  拜托  这儿没有左可以往左了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, you know what? There is no more left, left!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.96,0:07:46.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  抬高到你的头上\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh okay, y'know lift it straight up over your head!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.21,0:07:48.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,抬高到你的头上  你行的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Straight up over your head. You can do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.76,0:07:50.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你行的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You can do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.17,0:07:52.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  没问题吧  很好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay. You got it? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.34,0:07:53.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  没问题吧  很好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Go, go. Good, good.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.84,0:07:56.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没问题吧  没问题吧  没问..\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You got it, right? You got it, right? You got--
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.77,0:08:04.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得放在那里好看吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Any chance you think the couch looks good there?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.23,0:08:07.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这家伙还在碎碎念\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...so this guy was all...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.98,0:08:10.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我就说  "重案组  布非"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And I'm all, "Buffay! Homicide!"
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.61,0:08:14.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真是太帅了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It was just so cool! Ha-ha-ha.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.87,0:08:16.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,菲比  你应该拿去还的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Phoebe, you were supposed to take that back.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.08,0:08:19.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道  但行善的感觉好棒\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I know, but I'm having so much fun doing good deeds.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.04,0:08:23.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但假扮警察很严重  你会被逮捕的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, but impersonating a police officer is a serious thing. You can get arrested.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.04,0:08:26.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你现在就会被逮捕\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You could get arrested right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.25,0:08:32.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  我得拿去还了  我被权力冲昏头了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right, yeah, I'd better take it back. I'm totally drunk with power.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.39,0:08:38.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  嘿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey. Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.98,0:08:43.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨  乔伊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hi, Joe.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.56,0:08:46.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道你们会在\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah. I didn't know you guys were gonna be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.44,0:08:49.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乔伊  你尝尝看  什么  为什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey Joey, do me a favor, sweetie. Taste this. What? Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.36,0:08:52.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是怎么了  没事啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What is going on with you? Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.24,0:08:53.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,拜托  你一整天都怪怪的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, come on! You've been acting strange all day.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.57,0:08:57.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  是有一件事  我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right. There is something. I, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.41,0:09:00.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我做了一个梦\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I kind of had a dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.66,0:09:03.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但我不想谈\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But I don't want to talk about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.16,0:09:07.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,马丁路德金恩也这么说  还得了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, whoa. What if Martin Luther King had said that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.71,0:09:11.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我有一个梦\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I kind of have a dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.30,0:09:14.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是我不想谈\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I don't want to talk about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.88,0:09:18.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,跟摩妮卡有关\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Look, it involved Monica.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.55,0:09:21.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你梦到我正在交往的女孩  真是酷啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You had a dream about a girl I'm seeing? Oh, that is so cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.60,0:09:23.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知梦见他的女朋友多少次\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I can't tell you how many times I dreamt about a girl he was seeing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.06,0:09:27.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,总之  我们在谈你的梦  我爱你  你的梦\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Anyway, we were talking about your dream. I love you. Your dream?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.06,0:09:31.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,放心  没有任何性意味  自从发现你们的事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Don't worry, there wasn't any sex in it. I haven't dreamt about her like that...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.61,0:09:34.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我就不对她做那种梦了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...since I found out about you two-ish.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.12,0:09:40.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那你梦到什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What was the dream about?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.62,0:09:42.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.41,0:09:47.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是我的女朋友  我们在填字谜\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You were my girlfriend. We were doing the crossword puzzle.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.29,0:09:49.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就像你们昨晚那样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Y'know like you guys were doing last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.33,0:09:52.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就这样  我爱上摩妮卡了 我会搬走\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So that's it. I'm in love with Monica and I'll be moving out.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.63,0:09:56.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乔伊  等等  那并不代表你爱我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wait, Joey, come on. That doesn't mean that you're in love with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.09,0:09:58.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不是吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It doesn't?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.30,0:10:00.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,它可能有很多涵义  例如\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It could mean anything. Like, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.39,0:10:03.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你突然眼红我成为这里的猛男\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...all of a sudden you're jealous that I've become the apartment stud.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.77,0:10:06.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这个  听起来比较像你的梦\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That kinda sounds like your dream, dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.19,0:10:13.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或是你看到我和钱德在一起  很亲密\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Or it could mean you saw Chandler and me together, and we y'know were being close and stuff...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.78,0:10:16.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你也想跟别人拥有这种亲密关系\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...and then you just want to have that with someone too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.57,0:10:18.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我在梦里的确很享受那种亲密\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}In the dream I did enjoy the closeness.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.41,0:10:20.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  听着\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.62,0:10:21.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你爱上摩妮卡了吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Are you attracted to Monica?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.12,0:10:24.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就是现在  此时此刻  爱上她了吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Right here, right now, are you attracted to her?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.79,0:10:29.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,其实没有  这就对了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Not really. There you have it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.08,0:10:33.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当然啊  我穿得这么随便\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Heh. Well, sure! I'm just wearing sweats!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.84,0:10:36.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但那是好事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But that's good!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.21,0:10:39.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你不是爱我  你只是想交个女朋友\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You're not in love with me. because you just want a girlfriend!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.55,0:10:42.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  我觉得不是交女朋友的问题\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, I don't think it's just about getting a girlfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.35,0:10:43.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对  我可以找个女朋友\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, Y'know? I mean, I could get a girlfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.89,0:10:47.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对  我们可以坐在那里填字谜\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, we could sit in the chair and do crossword puzzles.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.23,0:10:50.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但我们会拥有你们那种亲密感觉吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But y'know are we ever gonna have y'know the closeness like you guys have?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.52,0:10:54.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,摩妮卡和我是从朋友做起的  也许关键在这里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Monica and I were friends before we started dating. Maybe that's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.78,0:10:56.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,先做朋友\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Friends first?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.90,0:10:58.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有意思\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.61,0:11:03.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们都事后当朋友  没有  也从来没有过\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You become friends after? No, never done that either.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.62,0:11:06.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  你们有量尺吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Um, do you guys have a tape measure?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.08,0:11:08.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有  在我房里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, yeah. It's actually in my bedroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.87,0:11:12.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没错\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.26,0:11:26.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乔伊  怎么了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What's up, Joey?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.52,0:11:31.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你好吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}How you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.86,0:11:43.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉  这是你的车吗  对\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Excuse me. Is this your car? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.53,0:11:46.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,停在这里不太好  你挡住出入口了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, I don't think it's nice of you to park here. You're blocking the entrance.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.99,0:11:48.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,放心  没关系的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Don't worry about it. It's not a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.12,0:11:54.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得有关系  你就有关系  因为我是条子\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's a problem for me, which means it's a problem for you because I'm a cop.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.38,0:11:57.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我也是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So am I.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.13,0:12:01.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,完了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.97,0:12:07.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  你是条子  可以任意停车\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, okay. so you're a cop which means you can park anywhere,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.26,0:12:09.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为我也是条子\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}'cause I know that 'cause I'm a cop too. 
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.52,0:12:12.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  继续努力  收到\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So, all right, keep up the good work. Ten-four.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.19,0:12:14.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等一下  你是哪个分局的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, wait a second! So wait, what precinct are you with?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.40,0:12:17.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我在57分局\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm with the, um, the 57th.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.86,0:12:21.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我认识你们重案组一位刑警  我在风化组\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I know a guy in Homicide up there. I'm in Vice.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.45,0:12:24.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,事实上  我正在卧底  我是妓女\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, In fact, I'm undercover right now. I'm a whore.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.28,0:12:29.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,风化组还有谁\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Who else is in Vice up there?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.20,0:12:31.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你认识\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Um, do you know, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.25,0:12:32.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,西波威兹吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...Sipowitz?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.33,0:12:35.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,西波威兹  不  应该不认识\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Sipowitz? No, I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.54,0:12:38.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对  西波威兹  大块头  有点秃\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah. Sipowitz. Yeah. Big guy, kind of bald.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.92,0:12:40.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不认识他\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I don't know him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.17,0:12:45.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不要打给他  他不在  他出去了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Don't try to call him or anything. Because he's not there. He's out.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.72,0:12:48.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他的拍档  刚死了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}His, um, partnerjust died.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.47,0:12:52.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,帮我跟西波威兹致意\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Tell Sipowitz I'm real sorry for his loss.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.48,0:12:54.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我会的  保重\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I sure will. Take care.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.15,0:12:57.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对了  我相信西波威兹不会有事的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, by the way, I'm sure Sipowitz is gonna be all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.02,0:13:00.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听说那个新来的小伙子很不错\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I heard that kid from Silver Spoons is really good.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.99,0:13:05.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你在哪里找到我的警徽的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And where did you find my badge?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.29,0:13:20.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  乔伊  你能不能帮我和罗斯搬沙发\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, Joey, would you mind giving me and Ross a hand moving his couch?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.50,0:13:23.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我很想  但我要去上表演课  但你知道\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Aw, I'd love to but I got acting class. But you know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.67,0:13:26.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我可以为了你跷课的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I guess I could blow that off for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.01,0:13:32.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.52,0:13:36.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瑞秋  我问你件事  我刚在对面跟摩妮卡和钱德聊天\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Uh, hey, Rach let me ask you something.Uh, I was just over there talking to Monica and Chandler, 
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.81,0:13:38.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们可真亲密\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Boy, they are really tight.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.86,0:13:39.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.07,0:13:42.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那种关系实在很不错\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah that's not such a bad situation they got going over there. 
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.44,0:13:46.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我也想自己弄一段\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm thinking of getting me one of those.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.62,0:13:51.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你想说什么  乔伊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What's up, Joe?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.54,0:13:54.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得他们感觉会那么好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}The reason I think Monica and Chandler are so great...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.16,0:13:57.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是因为他们是先做朋友\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...is because they were friends first, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.00,0:14:02.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,于是我问自己  谁是我朋友  你和菲比\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So I asked myself, who are my friends? You and Phoebe.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.55,0:14:04.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而我先遇见你  所以\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I saw you first, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.97,0:14:12.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你在说什么  我是说也许你我可以更进一步\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What are you saying? I'm saying maybe you and I crank it up a notch.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.35,0:14:17.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乔伊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know, honey, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.19,0:14:20.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你先过见我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}..as, uh, flattered as I am...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.73,0:14:23.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真令我受宠若惊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...that you saw me first...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.15,0:14:28.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但我不觉得我们应该更进一步\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...uhh, I just, I-I don't think we should be cranking anything up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.36,0:14:30.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我会对你很好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'll treat you real nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.04,0:14:40.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对  你知道吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah. Well, you know, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.59,0:14:46.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得先做朋友再交往  是一个很好的想法\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Listen, I think it's a great idea to become friends with someone before you date.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.97,0:14:51.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但你应该先去认识一个人  跟她做朋友\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But I think the way you do it is you meet someone, become their friend...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.30,0:14:54.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,建立基础  再约她出去\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...build a foundation, then ask them out on a date.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.02,0:14:57.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别对现有的朋友下手\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Don't hit on your existing friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.27,0:15:01.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那不是要等很久了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Won't that take longer?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.56,0:15:04.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没错  没错\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.40,0:15:06.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是一旦得到了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, but once you find it...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.57,0:15:08.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真的很值得\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...it's so worth the wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.86,0:15:10.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.07,0:15:12.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我懂  我懂\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I understand. I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.32,0:15:14.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.33,0:15:16.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天啊  如果先遇见菲比就好了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Man, I wish I saw Phoebe first.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.50,0:15:21.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,来我身边吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Come here to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.63,0:15:25.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  不  你来我身边\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, no. You come here to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.09,0:15:29.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  罗斯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, Ross.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.47,0:15:32.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我带援军来了  太好了  是乔伊吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ahem, I brought reinforcements. Oh, great! You brought Joey?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.76,0:15:34.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只比他差点\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14} Well, I brought the next best thing. Heh.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.39,0:15:35.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey-
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.56,0:15:40.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,钱德  你带钱德来  只差一点的应该是摩妮卡\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Chandler?!  You brought Chandler? The next best thing would be Monica!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.56,0:15:45.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我应该感觉不爽了  但摩妮卡真的壮得可怕\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Y'know, I would be offended, but Monica is freakishly strong...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.15,0:15:48.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看  我画了一张搬运草图\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Look, I drew a sketch of how we'll do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.82,0:15:50.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  瑞秋  这是你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay ,Rach, that's you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.95,0:15:52.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是沙发\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's the couch.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.11,0:15:55.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, what's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.49,0:15:56.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, that's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.33,0:16:03.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你把自己看得很雄壮喔\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14} You certainly think a lot of yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.38,0:16:07.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  那是我的手臂\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No. That's my arm.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.59,0:16:15.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喔  我还以为你那么喜欢你的新沙发\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, I see. I thought you just really, really liked your new couch.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.85,0:16:20.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,总之听我的指示\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Just follow my lead.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.81,0:16:22.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}0key.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.14,0:16:24.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,钱德  来吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Come on, Chandler.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.44,0:16:27.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  开始了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.02,0:16:30.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,开始了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.40,0:16:31.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可以了吗  可以\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right. Ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.36,0:16:34.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,转  好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Turn! Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.61,0:16:35.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,转\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Turn!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.82,0:16:37.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,转\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Turn!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.91,0:16:42.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,应该是转不动了  我觉得挤不上去\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I don't think we can turn anymore! I don't think it'll fit!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.37,0:16:45.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当然可以  快抬起来  抬起来  抬起来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, it will. Come on! Up, up, up!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.54,0:16:47.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,抬起来  很好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}UP! Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.96,0:16:49.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很好  中心点\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Here we go! Pivot!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.67,0:16:52.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,中心点\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Pivot!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.51,0:16:55.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,中心点\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Pivot!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.55,0:16:57.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,中心点\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Pivot!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.60,0:17:00.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,中心点\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Pivot!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.85,0:17:01.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,中心点\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Pivot!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.06,0:17:05.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,闭嘴  闭嘴  闭嘴\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Shut up! Shut up! Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.11,0:17:11.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  我看是上不来了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I don't think it's gonna pivot anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.78,0:17:13.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You think?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.49,0:17:19.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  搬下去再来一次\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right, let's, uh, bring it back down and try again.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.33,0:17:29.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在真的卡死了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I think it's really stuck now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.46,0:17:35.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,想不到居然没成功  就是啊  我也没想到\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I can't believe that didn't work. I know. Me neither.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.26,0:17:36.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你都画了图了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I mean, you had a sketch.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.80,0:17:41.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你说那个 "中心点"是什么意思\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What did you mean when you said "pivot"?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.35,0:17:47.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  嘿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey. Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.56,0:17:50.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么样  有交到新朋友吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}How's it going? Did you make any new friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.36,0:17:52.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有  我认识了一个女人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah. I met this woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.11,0:17:54.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  哇  哇\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey. Whoa, whoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.07,0:17:56.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她怎么样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What's she like?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.82,0:17:58.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Uh, well, she's...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.70,0:18:00.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,床上功夫很棒\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...really good in bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.74,0:18:03.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乔伊  你不是要先当朋友嘛\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Joey, I thought you were going to try to be friends first.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.95,0:18:07.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,都是你的错  什么  为什么啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well look, hey, it's all your fault. What? Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.29,0:18:10.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为你给的不是忠告  是搭讪词\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well because you didn't give me advice. No! You gave me a pickup line.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.63,0:18:14.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我一说要 "建立基础  先当朋友"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}As soon as I told her I wanted to y'know, "build a foundation and be friends first."
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.63,0:18:19.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她突然就...与我本身无关  觉得我难以抗拒\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I suddenly, through no fault of my own, I became irresistible to her!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.47,0:18:21.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她的室友也是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And her roommate!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.97,0:18:25.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那亲密关系呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What about the "closeness"?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.14,0:18:30.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谁还管亲密啊  我们玩三P啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Closeness, schmosness! There was three of us, for crying out loud!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.11,0:18:36.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谁要吃彼萨\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right! Hey, Who wants pizza?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.95,0:18:38.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要  我要  我要\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I do! I do! I do!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.07,0:18:42.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,赞  这是我在二楼捡到的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, great! Can you believe I found this on the second floor?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.91,0:18:47.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哪位  纽约警察\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Who is it? NYPD.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.08,0:18:50.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天啊  天啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, my God! Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.54,0:18:52.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等下  警察先生\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Uh, just a minute, officer!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.68,0:19:06.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要找菲比布非  完了  是他  是那个警察\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm looking for Phoebe Buff ay. My God, it's him! It's that cop!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.52,0:19:10.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他居然找到我了  天哪  菲比  你会去坐牢吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I can't believe he found me! Oh my God, Phoebe,Are you going to go to jail?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.98,0:19:13.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我死也会拖你们下水的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, If I'm going down, you guys are going down with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.82,0:19:19.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,窝藏逃犯  起码要关1到3年\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Harboring a fugitive? That's one-to-three years minimum.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.82,0:19:21.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,钱德  祝你好运\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Good luck, Chandler.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.16,0:19:29.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  你可以逮捕我  但你抓不到我的把柄\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, you can arrest me, Fine. but you'll never make it stick and you know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.37,0:19:32.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但我别无选择  这是我的职责所在  你了解吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, but I kinda don't have a choice, it's my job. You understand, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.92,0:19:35.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当然  只要你了解我  会找我的律师来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, as long as you understand that I'm gonna call my lawyer.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.92,0:19:39.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他会让你在庭上像个猪头  猪头\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And once he puts you on the stand, he's gonna make you look like a fool! Like a fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.63,0:19:43.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不喜欢当猪头\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I don't like looking foolish.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.05,0:19:48.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这样吧  也许我今天不抓你  就说我来了 但你不在\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Y'know what? Maybe, uh, I don't arrest you today. Maybe I came by and you weren't here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.39,0:19:50.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不在就太好了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I would love it if I weren't here!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.31,0:19:55.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,既然你今晚不会入狱  我能不能\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, so since umm, you're not going to jail tonight, I was wondering if you'd, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.61,0:19:57.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,请你和我去晚餐\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...like to go to dinner with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.53,0:19:59.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我  对\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Me? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.94,0:20:03.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,自从你对我亮警徽  我就对你念念不忘\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ever since you flashed my badge at me, I kind of can't stop thinking about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.03,0:20:07.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是我见过的最美的假卧底妓女\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You're the prettiest fake undercover whore I've ever seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.45,0:20:11.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,漂亮\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.46,0:20:16.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想不到你会来  约我出去\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wow, I didn't see that coming. You're asking me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.13,0:20:20.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我可以表现得更好  但这些人一直盯着我看\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, I could've done it better, but these people keep staring at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.72,0:20:24.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  我愿意跟你出去吃饭  警察先生\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Um, yeah, I'd like to go out with you, officer.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.80,0:20:27.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,盖瑞  盖瑞\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Gary. Gary.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.76,0:20:29.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那就这么说定了  好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, so it's a date. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.93,0:20:32.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不过我一定要问  你是怎么找到我的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah! So--ooh, I gotta ask you, though. How did you know where to find me?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.81,0:20:35.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的警徽上都是你的指纹  所以我上电脑查询\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Your fingerprints were all over my badge so I ran them through the computer.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.06,0:20:38.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是你最后登记的住址  所以我就来看看\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}This was listed as your last known address so I checked it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.94,0:20:39.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好厉害\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.15,0:20:44.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有你厉害  我看过你的纪录  你干过不少怪事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Not as impressive as you. I looked at your record and you've done some weird stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.24,0:20:46.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,吃饭时再说\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We'll talk at dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.57,0:20:47.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}0key.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.99,0:20:50.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我两个小时后来接你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So I'll come by in a couple hours and pick you up?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.20,0:20:51.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  我好兴奋\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right, I can't wait. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.87,0:20:54.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,放心  我不会只带你吃甜甜圈\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Don't worry, I won't just take you out for doughnuts.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.09,0:20:59.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他有枪\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}He has a gun!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.01,0:21:09.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要退这张沙发  我不满意\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'd like to return this couch. I'm not satisfied with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.52,0:21:17.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你要退这张沙发\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You want to return this couch?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.52,0:21:21.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,它断成两半了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's cut in half.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.07,0:21:26.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我就是这个意思  是你把它切成两半的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's what I'm telling you. Did you out this couch in half?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.74,0:21:30.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这张沙发被切成两半\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}This couch is cut in half!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.25,0:21:37.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要换一张没有被切成两半的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I would like to exchange it for one that is not cut in half.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.54,0:21:41.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是说它送过去就这样了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You're telling me this couch was delivered to you like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.21,0:21:43.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我很讲道理\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Look, I'm a reasonable man.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.59,0:21:46.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我愿意接受换购抵用券\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I will accept store credit.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.39,0:21:51.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我给你4元的换购抵用券\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'll give you store credit in the amount of $4.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.85,0:21:56.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我接受\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I Will take it.
